<title>USA: Overland Data says over-allotment exercised.</title>
<headline>Overland Data says over-allotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overland Data Inc on Tuesday said underwriters Jefferies &amp; Co Inc and Cruttenden Roth Inc have exercised their option to acquire 450,000 shares of common stock to cover over-allotments in the company's recent public offering.</p>
<p>Including the over-allotment, the offering consisted of 3.45 million shares of which over 2.8 million were sold by the company and over 613,000 by selling shareholders.</p>
<p>Overland Data ended up 3/4 at 12-1/2 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
